---
source: crates/nb-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: help
---
notability content — Read and edit what is inside a note: text, math, code, ink, shapes, comments, pages

Usage: notability content <command>

Commands:
  comments  Page comments and replies
  images    Images placed on pages
  ink       Handwriting: pen and highlighter strokes, eraser
  math      Math blocks (LaTeX)
  move      Move a selection of ink, shapes, images or blocks
  pages     Pages: list, add, delete, reorder, paper templates
  shapes    Shapes: rectangle, ellipse, triangle, arrow, line
  show      Decoded edit log: pages, text boxes, math, code, ink, shapes, comments, images
  text      Typed text and text boxes: styles, paragraphs, checklists, code blocks

Global Options:
  --filter-output <keys>              Filter output by key paths (e.g. foo,bar.baz,a[0,3])
  --format <toon|json|yaml|md|jsonl>  Output format
  --full-output                       Show full output envelope
  --help                              Show help
  --llms, --llms-full                 Print LLM-readable manifest
  --schema                            Show JSON Schema for command
  --token-count                       Print token count of output (instead of output)
  --token-limit <n>                   Limit output to n tokens
  --token-offset <n>                  Skip first n tokens of output
